1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,540
Gumagana ba ang
solar panels sa gabi?

2
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:05,660
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:10,430
Hindi. Kailangan ng liwanag
para gumawa ng kuryente.

4
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:12,560
Kung solar ang
gamit mo sa gabi,

5
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:16,270
galing 'yan sa battery
na nag-charge noong araw.

6
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:20,960
Kapag wala o ubos na ang
battery, grid na ang kukunan.

7
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:26,570
Magkaiba ang solar
generation at stored energy.

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:32,180
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

9
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,990
Life is SoLight with Solar.
